# Every text file is LF on every checkout. A Windows clone with
# core.autocrlf=true otherwise turns `#!/usr/bin/env node\r` into a SyntaxError
# when vitest import()s a hashbang script (AR-5, AR-51), and turns every rule
# file, skill and fixture into CRLF that the tests reading them do not expect
# (AR-93, measured at 87ab648: 79 windows-latest failures, most of them
# `\r\n`). `text=auto`
# leaves binaries alone; the index carried LF only when this was widened.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.mjs text eol=lf
*.sh  text eol=lf
